{"sequence": 7, "time_utc": "2026-10-13T11:33:54.875034+00:00", "node": "analysis", "action": "search_evidence", "status": "ok", "elapsed_ms": 0.12, "input": {"query": "风险 成本 工程"}, "output": {"results": [{"id": "E-STRATEGY", "title": "动量研究规则与风险表达", "source": "user_data/strategies/SarkazV3F.py; research/operations/v3f_original_oos_resume_2026-10-03/MARKET_ACHIEVEMENTS.md", "trust": "archived_research", "text": "策略以成交活跃度、结构突破和市场状态过滤组织入场，下一根 K 线收盘确认；初始风险锚点贯穿盈利加仓及跟踪退出。工程工作台复用冻结回测资产，不承担交易执行。", "source_hash": "17ea26bf525314ee13d7f3a6c7345ed8c16d4e285786ac60fe7d6a24f90f7839"}, {"id": "E-METRICS", "title": "账户收益与成本核验口径", "source": "research_agent/metrics.py + audit.py", "trust": "deterministic_contract", "text": "收益由平仓利润重建；CAGR 使用原生有效回测日数的 365 日年化；Sharpe 使用每日账户收益的样本标准差与 sqrt(365)。成本情景按每笔全部进出及加仓成交名义金额追加成本，并在该笔平仓时入账。固定交易路径，不重新求解仓位。", "source_hash": "aa2c0330f7ed7a8c9fbddcaf52e2bf3dc4c742464a8caa7f8f91294a31fd85c4"}, {"id": "E-ENGINEERING", "title": "原交易系统的工程模块", "source": "WORKSPACE_ASSET_MAP.md; scripts/maintenance/build_freqtrade_dryrun_stack.py; deployments/dryrun-telegram-monitor/ftdry.py", "trust": "archived_research", "text": "既有系统具有 Freqtrade/CCXT 交易接口集成、Docker 双容器部署、各自独立 SQLite 状态与 REST 只读监控。已归档发布报告记录 dry-run 云端运行。工作台通过离线资产适配器接入研究结果。", "source_hash": "392a379ff693809e9f2b4cf7c17a854b37e8329b6d13ab74b22d0c690c2c65ae"}, {"id": "E-BACKTEST", "title": "Sarkaz V3F 连续历史回测", "source": "research/operations/v3f_full_history_2026-10-03/REPORT_CN.md", "trust": "archived_research", "text": "冻结 SarkazV3F 在连续账户中运行，原生回测 922 笔，单边手续费 5 bps，未计资金费；已实现权益在平仓时确认。全历史包含开发及后续观察区间。公开样本保留逐笔净利润与全部成交名义金额。", "source_hash": "e9af77e377fb2ecd96754b43c19941b0447a098b766a2075f5ba42b1b767c86b"}], "retrieval": "bounded lexical ranking over curated evidence; no embedding index"}, "output_sha256": "411a30070d40cf143a2d71b28c4f8bf3ea37edd1e8aed2e824e7f006e16e6c67"}
